{"type":"message","id":"897ac0bf","parentId":"3fe0a93b","timestamp":"2026-04-13T22:01:32.323Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8e4c0e5be3124d5284a32fec","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-04-14 (화)\n\n## Cron Health\n- **CRITICAL:** daily-github-backup push failed (403 error)\n  - Local commit successful (46 files changed, 828 insertions, 1570 deletions)\n  - Commit ID: 7b5be2f1\n  - Error: Permission denied to NousResearch/hermes-agent.git for Lfantasial\n- **Security Audit:** Completed at 03:00 KST\n  - **Critical Findings (2):**\n    1. autoAllowSkills enabled (trust risk)\n    2. Multi-user heuristic triggered - open Telegram group policy with runtime/process tools exposed\n  - **Warning (1):** Permissive plugin tool policy for claude-mem\n  - **Known False Positives Excluded:** tavily-search (2 files), claude-mem (5 files), writing-skills (1 file)\n\n## System Status\n- Gateway restart ok (npm)\n- **OpenClaw:** Update available (npm 2026.4.12, current: pnpm stable)\n- **Skills:** All up to date\n\n## Heartbeat Notes\n- Day rollover to 2026-04-14\n- GitHub backup push failure at 04:00 KST\n- Security audit completed at 03:00 KST\n- Update check completed at 06:00 KST: OpenClaw 2026.4.12 available, skills up to date\n- Scheduled heartbeat at 06:59 KST (no material changes)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776117692319}}
